@startuml agentic-autonomous-coverage-map
title Agentic/Autonomous Coverage Map ; per ADR-ES-022 section 6

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Capability" as Cap
class "Value Stream" as VS
class "Service" as Svc
class "Product" as Prod
class "Offering" as Off
class "Operations" as Ops
class "Organization" as Org
class "Enterprise" as Ent
class "Workflow" as Wf

Cap --> Cap : Agentic + Autonomous
VS --> VS : Agentic + Autonomous
Svc --> Svc : Agentic + Autonomous
Prod --> Prod : Agentic + Autonomous
Off --> Off : Agentic + Autonomous
Ops --> Ops : Agentic + Autonomous
Org --> Org : Agentic + Autonomous
Ent --> Ent : Agentic + Autonomous
Wf --> Wf : Agentic only (no Autonomous per ADR-ES-022 section 13)

note bottom of Wf
  Autonomous Workflow intentionally absent per ADR-ES-022
  section 13. Separate semantic decision required.
end note

@enduml
